flowchart TD
    Start([KeplerianOrbit.js]) --> Class1[Class: Orbit]
    
    Class1 --> OrbitConstructor[Constructor orbitData, GM]
    OrbitConstructor --> OrbitInit[Initialize orbital elements:<br/>• semiMajorAxis a<br/>• eccentricity e<br/>• inclination i<br/>• longitudeOfAscendingNode Ω<br/>• argumentOfPeriapsis ω<br/>• meanAnomalyAtEpoch M₀<br/>• epochTime<br/>• GM gravitational parameter]
    
    OrbitInit --> CalcMeanMotion[Calculate mean motion:<br/>n = √ GM/a³]
    CalcMeanMotion --> OrbitMethods{Orbit Methods}
    
    OrbitMethods --> GetPosition[getPositionAtTime currentTime]
    GetPosition --> TimeSince[timeSinceEpoch = currentTime - epochTime]
    TimeSince --> CalcMean[meanAnomaly M = M₀ + n × Δt]
    CalcMean --> SolveKepler[Call solveKeplersEquation M]
    
    SolveKepler --> Normalize[Normalize M to -π to π]
    Normalize --> InitialGuess{eccentricity < 0.8?}
    InitialGuess -->|Yes| GuessM[Initial E = M]
    InitialGuess -->|No| GuessPi[Initial E = π]
    
    GuessM --> NewtonLoop
    GuessPi --> NewtonLoop[Newton-Raphson iteration:<br/>maxIterations = 50<br/>tolerance = 1e-12]
    
    NewtonLoop --> CalcError[error = E - e×sinE - M<br/>derivative = 1 - e×cosE<br/>delta = error / derivative]
    CalcError --> UpdateE[E = E - delta]
    UpdateE --> CheckConv{abs delta < tolerance?}
    
    CheckConv -->|No| CalcError
    CheckConv -->|Yes| ReturnE[Return E]
    
    ReturnE --> ConvertTrue[Call eccentricToTrue E]
    ConvertTrue --> TrueCalc[cosE = cos E<br/>sinE = sin E<br/>sqrtTerm = √ 1-e²<br/>ν = atan2 sqrtTerm×sinE, cosE-e]
    TrueCalc --> CalcDist[distance r = a × 1 - e×cosE]
    CalcDist --> Calc2D[angle = ν + ω<br/>x = r × cos angle<br/>y = r × sin angle]
    Calc2D --> ReturnPos[Return x, y, distance, ν, E, M]
    
    OrbitMethods --> GetPeriod[getOrbitalPeriod]
    GetPeriod --> PeriodCalc[period = 2π / n<br/>Return period in seconds]
    
    Start --> Class2[Class: CelestialBody]
    
    Class2 --> BodyConstructor[Constructor name, mass, radius, color, orbit, spritePath]
    BodyConstructor --> BodyInit[Initialize:<br/>• name, mass, radius, color<br/>• orbit can be null for Sun<br/>• spritePath<br/>• position: x: 0, y: 0<br/>• velocity: x: 0, y: 0<br/>• trail: empty array]
    
    BodyInit --> BodyMethods{CelestialBody Methods}
    
    BodyMethods --> UpdatePos[updatePosition currentTime]
    UpdatePos --> HasOrbit{orbit exists?}
    HasOrbit -->|No| SkipSun[Return Sun doesn't move]
    HasOrbit -->|Yes| GetState[state = orbit.getPositionAtTime currentTime]
    GetState --> SetPos[position.x = state.x<br/>position.y = state.y]
    
    BodyMethods --> AddTrail[addToTrail maxTrailLength]
    AddTrail --> PushPoint[Push current x, y to trail array]
    PushPoint --> CheckLength{trail.length > max?}
    CheckLength -->|Yes| RemoveOld[Remove oldest point shift]
    CheckLength -->|No| TrailDone[Trail updated]
    RemoveOld --> TrailDone
    
    BodyMethods --> GetBodyPeriod[getOrbitalPeriod]
    GetBodyPeriod --> HasOrbitPeriod{orbit exists?}
    HasOrbitPeriod -->|Yes| CallOrbitPeriod[Return orbit.getOrbitalPeriod]
    HasOrbitPeriod -->|No| ReturnNull[Return null]
    
    Start --> Class3[Class: SolarSystem]
    
    Class3 --> Factory[Static Method: createAllBodies]
    Factory --> InitArray[bodies = empty array]
    InitArray --> LoopData{For each in Body.planetData}
    
    LoopData -->|Sun| CreateSun[No orbit for Sun<br/>Create CelestialBody:<br/>name, mass, radius, color<br/>orbit = null, spritePath<br/>Set position: 0, 0]
    CreateSun --> AddSun[Push to bodies array]
    AddSun --> LoopData
    
    LoopData -->|Planet| GetGM[GM = Body.getGravitationalParameter key]
    GetGM --> CreateOrbit[Create new Orbit planetData.orbit, GM]
    CreateOrbit --> CreatePlanet[Create new CelestialBody:<br/>name, mass, radius, color<br/>orbit, spritePath]
    CreatePlanet --> AddPlanet[Push to bodies array]
    AddPlanet --> LoopData
    
    LoopData -->|Done| ReturnBodies[Return bodies array]
    
